Thank you for visiting our website regarding your experience with LATAM Air=
lines on July 5, 2024.  Unfortunately, this firm is unable to accept profes=
sional responsibility on your behalf. By this statement, we do not pass jud=
gement upon the merit of any potential case.

Please be advised that there are time limitations that govern when a lawsui=
t or claim must be brought in this country and internationally.  Depending =
on the nature of the cause of action which might be pursued, the statute of=
 limitations may vary.  Failure to file and pursue a case in a timely manne=
r can result in its dismissal.  Whether other factors exist which may short=
en or extend any applicable statute of limitations is unknown to us.  There=
fore, should you decide to pursue this matter further, we respectfully sugg=
est that you contact another attorney of your choice immediately so that yo=
ur legal rights may be fully explored and protected.  Do not delay.

The confidence you have exhibited in our firm by writing us is very much ap=
preciated.  We wish you well.


Sincerely,

